# Keep the Docker build context small and reproducible: exclude build output,
# IDE/editor state, VCS metadata, and test/sample projects the CLI image doesn't
# need. Restore/publish inside the image regenerates bin/ and obj/ cleanly.

## Build output
**/[Bb]in/
**/[Oo]bj/
**/[Oo]ut/

## Git / CI metadata
.git/
.github/
.claude/

## IDE / editor
.idea/
.vs/
.vscode/
*.DotSettings
*.DotSettings.user

## Test results
**/[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml

## OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

## Docker
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
